61.694838	- **Silent truncation if `PER_EXPERT` ≠ actual slice size**  
61.694845	  `pread` may read less than needed; `memcpy` copies only the available bytes, corrupting the slice. Verify `PER_EXPERT == slice_len` and add `return` on short read.
